pers, `Prune`, sidecar `materialise` and its cache locks (`sidecar.go`), and the workspace half of Cleanup (`proc_unix.go` ~294-321). `local` keeps processes, Docker and tracking and calls `workspace`. Add the role-dir copy option (`CopyRole`) and `GOFLAGS=-buildvcs=false` for Docker jobs. Tests move with the code; `docs/layout.md` updated.\n\n**Design:** [#54 design comment](https://github.com/albertcbrown/ard/issues/54#issuecomment-7131825898) (owner-approved). **Size:** M. **Who:** worker.\n**Part of:** #54\n**Depends on:** #312\n\n","numLines":19,"startLine":1,"totalLines":19}},"tool_result_meta":[{"id":"toolu_01VtZsmvwVrtKbyNJn1dLP6H","permission_decision":{"decision":"accept","source":"config","reason_type":"rule"}}]}
